# CausaCare Open

Open-source platform for social kitchens and elderly support.

## First pilot: Burgas, Bulgaria

CausaCare Open helps volunteers, social kitchens and donors coordinate free meals and assistance for elderly people.

## Features
- Social kitchen registration
- Meal distribution planning
- Volunteer coordination
- Donation tracking
- Elderly assistance requests
- Bulgarian, German and English support

## Technology
Open-source software developed with AI assistance.

